      "E is a real inner-product space. In the nonlinear phase declaration it additionally has CompleteSpace, FiniteDimensional, MeasurableSpace and BorelSpace instances; the metric definition/energy comparisons do not assume these extra structures. Each theorem argument supplies its own parameter assumptions.",
